"This is a theme for the Plank or Latte dock. Ubuntu Dock and Dash to Panel "
"cannot use it."
msgstr ""
"Es un tema para el dock Plank o Latte. Ubuntu Dock y Dash to Panel no pueden "
"usarlo."

